  "description": "HITKUU crystallizes in the hexagonal crystal system with space group P 63. Reported CIF formula moiety: C78 H124 Cl6 N6 O13 Tb3 Zn3 1-,3(C6 H16 N1 1+),3(C2 H6 O1),Cl4 Zn1 2-,0.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Tb1B (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Zn1B (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Tb1D (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Zn1D (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.466-3.815 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.43-115.06°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C102H191Cl10N9O16.5Tb3Zn4.",
